{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "344465a1-69db-4e39-a954-059fe8aaed4b",
    "name": "File Storage Service",
    "description": "Coleção para o microserviço file_storage_service (multi-tenant).\n\n**Variáveis:** `baseUrl`, `token` (api_key do projeto; o POST criar projeto preenche), `projetoId`, `arquivoId`.\n\n**Admin:**\n1. **JWT (recomendado):** defina `adminEmail` e `adminPassword` (iguais a `ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_*` no `.env` na primeira vez). Execute **Auth → POST login admin** — o script grava o JWT em `tokenAdmin`.\n2. **Ou** defina `tokenAdmin` manualmente com `API_KEY_ADMIN` (compat. scripts / legado).\n\n**Saúde:** `GET /estado` devolve processo + base_dados num JSON; `/health` e `/ready` continuam disponíveis.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "44405983",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/44405983-344465a1-69db-4e39-a954-059fe8aaed4b?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Saude",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET estado (processo + base de dados)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/estado",
            "description": "JSON: `processo` (ok) e `base_dados` (ready | not_ready). HTTP 503 se a PostgreSQL falhar."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET health (liveness)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET ready (readiness + Postgres)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/ready"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth (admin)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST login admin (grava JWT em tokenAdmin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    try {",
                  "        var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "        if (j && j.access_token) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenAdmin', j.access_token);",
                  "        }",
                  "    } catch (e) {}",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin/login",
            "description": "Usa as variáveis `adminEmail` e `adminPassword`. Resposta: `access_token`, `token_type`, `expires_in`. O teste automático copia `access_token` para `tokenAdmin` para as rotas seguintes."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin (projetos)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST criar projeto",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    try {",
                  "        var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "        if (j && j.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('projetoId', j.id); }",
                  "        if (j && j.api_key) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.api_key); }",
                  "    } catch (e) {}",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Projeto de teste\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/projetos",
            "description": "Requer JWT em `tokenAdmin` (login) ou `API_KEY_ADMIN` na mesma variável."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET listar projetos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/projetos"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET uploads recentes (atividade global)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/atividade/uploads-recentes?limite=20",
            "description": "Array JSON: nome_arquivo, projeto_id, projeto_nome, tamanho, criado_em. Query opcional `limite` (1–100, default 20). Requer migração 0005 (RLS admin)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET metricas armazenamento (uso + cota)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/metricas/armazenamento",
            "description": "Resposta: `bytes_usados` (soma na BD), `bytes_cota` (opcional, env COTA_ARMAZENAMENTO_BYTES), `percentagem` (0–100 se houver cota)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE apagar projeto",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/projetos/{{projetoId}}"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Arquivos",
